ening for gestational diabetes</article-title>.<source>Diabetes Care</source><year>1999</year>;<volume>22</volume>:<fpage>418</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>421</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10097921</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Naylor</surname><given-names>CD</given-names></name><name><surname>Sermer</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Farine</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Selective screening for gestational diabetes mellitus</article-title>.<source>N Engl J Med</source><year>1997</year>;<volume>337</volume>:<fpage>1591</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1596</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9371855</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B15"><label>15</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Weeks</surname><given-names>JW</given-names></name><name><surname>Major</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>de Veciana</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Morgan</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gestational diabetes: does the presence of risk factors influence perinatal outcome?</article-title><source>Am J Obstet Gynecol</source><year>1994</year>;<volume>171</volume>:<fpage>1003</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1007</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7943062</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B16"><label>16</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Griffin</surname><given-names>ME</given-names></name><name><surname>Coffey</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Scanlon</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Foley</surname